      en: ["Construction of the cathedral was completed around 1776.", "It is located directly on the banks of the Bons Sinais River in Quelimane.", "The architecture features a prominent facade with twin bell towers.", "During the 19th century, it was the most important church in Zambezia province.", "The building was abandoned following the inauguration of the new cathedral in 1970.", "Currently, there are projects dedicated to preserving the historic ruins."],
